'''Bloodstone''' is a material used to craft the "Blood" version of some [[Ashlands]] weapons. They have a chance to be found in the [[Charred chest]]s inside [[Charred Fortress]]es located in Ashlands. 

A weapon upgraded with Bloodstone has its damage increased by 0.2% for every HP the player is missing. It is not HP the target is missing.

