'''Thunderblood Essence''' is a material used to ugprade Nord weapons to their Thunderblood variants. They are dropped by [[Fallen Warriors]] summoned by placing three [[Memorial Coal]] on the altar found at the [[Memorial Place]].

Thunderblood weapons have a slightly increased amount of their main damage type and will also gain [[Lightning]] damage.

Thunderblood weapons have a 25% chance per hit of triggering [[chain lightning]], similar to Ashlands weapons upgraded using [[Iolite]] along with a 0.2% increase in damage for each health point the player is missing, similar to Ashlands weapons upgraded using [[Bloodstone]].

